joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"e925608361d48d5b80b0b9df09f7e291d4fa771807a3eb2735bbbb06bf114daa","event_uuid":"4205410d-be99-419e-a6b5-9f2e40ac5943","position":{"commit_sha":"851c0df8854a05178960024f19e5c781244d38c9","position":"1794494769374730001-4205410d-be99-419e-a6b5-9f2e40ac5943"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":"claude-code_2-1-311_agent","claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":"3d705fec-b472-45ca-b9ca-e9472648a082","comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Related: rebar already has a per-model output ceiling table, MODEL_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS (see cumulative-insensible-asianlion for Nova). Maverick is likely just missing from it; check that table before designing anything new.","timestamp":1794466808627930001},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan written (queued by the coordinator after successive-deceptive-xiphias). Direct Bedrock probe 2026-11-12 02:49 PST: Maverick and Scout both cap output at 8192 (8192 ok, 8193 and 16000 rejected).","timestamp":1794480671150175001},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Live probe 2026-11-12 03:01 PST (Bedrock us-west-2, frontier-bedrock, fix-gecko worktree with the fix uncommitted, same diff as the commit): PydanticAIRunner single_turn run of us.meta.llama4-maverick-17b-instruct-v1:0 with cfg.max_tokens at the default 16000 completed: text ok, finish_reason stop, 1 request. RED: 6 new tests failed pre-fix (5 ceiling ids + the default-cap request settings), 40/40 pass after including test_review_output_budget.py.","timestamp":1794481282859537001},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Commit 0b2385cdd3c: make verify exit 0, 03:03-05:04 PST 2026-11-12 (21167 passed, 29 skipped; integration 218 passed, 2 skipped). Pushed as Gerrit 3371; awaiting votes.","timestamp":1794488742581796001},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Gerrit 3371: Verified +1, but LLM-Review -1 is a fail-closed coverage gap, not a code finding: the review bot got AccessDenied from Bedrock because the account's BedrockDailySpendCapDeny policy is attached (it detaches automatically at 00:00 UTC = 16:00 PST). Local frontier and frontier-bedrock profiles are denied the same way (checked 2026-11-12 ~05:45 PST). Next: after the cap lifts, comment rerun-llm-review on 3371, then safe-submit and close.","timestamp":1794490677339706001},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"HANDOFF STATE 2026-11-12 06:45 PST (session 3d705fec): in_progress, held. Gerrit 3371 (commit 0b2385cdd3c) is pushed; Verified +1, LLM-Review -1 (spend cap). Blocked: the Bedrock daily spend cap (BedrockDailySpendCapDeny) is attached to the review bot's role (rebar-gerrit-instance-role) and to the lmn production roles, so LLM-Review casts a fail-closed coverage-gap -1 with no code findings. It lifts automatically at 00:00 UTC (16:00 PST). Lifting it early is a spend-policy call, so it is left for the operator. Remaining steps, in order: after 16:00 PST, comment `rerun-llm-review` on 3371 if the vote is still the coverage gap; at LLM-Review +1 / Verified +1 / 0 unresolved, run scripts/gerrit_safe_submit.py 3371 --revision <current sha>; fast-forward the worktree; post completion evidence, tick the AC boxes, and close with `--class preexisting`.","timestamp":1794494769374730001}],"created_at":1794466773468852001,"creation_channel":"python","deps":[{"link_uuid":"c3a56de3-cf4b-4dd8-a73b-b13ee3ef4b33","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"a81a-946a-31c9-4d03"},{"link_uuid":"601ffc1c-53f7-4761-b0e4-b1f73aa7b55c","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"205f-30e8-c19f-44ca"}],"description":"## Observation\n\nOn 2026-11-11 a live agentic run of `us.meta.llama4-maverick-17b-instruct-v1:0` on Bedrock (us-west-2) with rebar's default `max_tokens` (`DEFAULT_MAX_TOKENS = 16000`, src/rebar/llm/config.py) was rejected before generation: HTTP 400 ValidationException \"The maximum tokens you requested exceeds the model limit of 8192\". The same run with `max_tokens=8192` completed. Found while fixing garlicky-leery-seal.\n\n## Root cause (measured)\n\n- rebar already clamps each request's output cap to a per-model ceiling: `structured_run` takes `min(effective cap, _known_model_output_ceiling(model))`, read from the single-source table `MODEL_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS` in `src/rebar/llm/review_kernel/verify.py` (the Nova entries were added the same way, bug cumulative-insensible-asianlion). The review paths also RAISE to that ceiling through `model_max_output_tokens`.\n- The table has no Llama 4 entry, so an unmapped Maverick keeps the 16000 default and Bedrock rejects every call.\n- Probed directly with boto3 Converse on 2026-11-12 02:49 PST (us-west-2, frontier-bedrock): `us.meta.llama4-maverick-17b-instruct-v1:0` and `us.meta.llama4-scout-17b-instruct-v1:0` both accept maxTokens 8192 (`end_turn`) and reject 8193 and 16000 with \"exceeds the model limit of 8192\".\n\n## Approach\n\nAdd `(\"llama4-maverick\", 8_192)` and `(\"llama4-scout\", 8_192)` to `MODEL_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS`, with a comment citing the measurement. The lookup is a substring match, so both the `us.` inference-profile ids and bare ids match. No config key, env var or flag; no other behaviour changes.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `src/rebar/llm/review_kernel/verify.py`\n- `tests/unit/test_max_tokens_model_ceiling_1019.py`\n\n## Testing\n\n- RED then GREEN in `tests/unit/test_max_tokens_model_ceiling_1019.py`:\n  - `model_max_output_tokens` returns 8192 for `bedrock:us.meta.llama4-maverick-17b-instruct-v1:0`, `us.meta.llama4-scout-17b-instruct-v1:0` and the bare ids (fails pre-fix: 16000).\n  - The structured-run request settings for Maverick with the default 16000 cap carry `max_tokens == 8192` (the clamp path every run uses; fails pre-fix).\n  - The existing Claude, Nova and unmapped-model rows are unchanged.\n- Live: one PydanticAIRunner run of Maverick on Bedrock with the DEFAULT `max_tokens` completes.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] A test that fails on the pre-fix tree shows Llama 4 Maverick and Scout resolve to an 8192 output ceiling.\n- [ ] A test that fails on the pre-fix tree shows a Maverick request built from the default 16000 cap is sent with max_tokens 8192.\n- [ ] Existing ceiling rows (Claude, Nova, unmapped fallback) are unchanged, shown by the existing tests passing.\n- [ ] [non-codebase] A live PydanticAIRunner run of `us.meta.llama4-maverick-17b-instruct-v1:0` on Bedrock with the default max_tokens completes, recorded as a comment.\n  provenance: environment=Bedrock us-west-2 via the frontier-bedrock profile from the fix-gecko worktree; principal=frontier-bedrock IAM identity; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — one runner call\n- [ ] [non-codebase] `env -u JIRA_URL -u JIRA_USER -u JIRA_API_TOKEN make verify` exits 0 on the commit pushed for review.\n  provenance: environment=macOS dev host, fix-gecko worktree; principal=Rebar Bot Nava; privilege_posture=narrower; instrument=live-call — exit status and log live outside the repository\n","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/review_kernel/verify.py","reason":"Llama 4 output ceilings in MODEL_MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_max_tokens_model_ceiling_1019.py","reason":"regression tests for the Llama 4 ceilings"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["relates_to","205f-30e8-c19f-44ca"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"5808859e-db16-4455-883e-3aebb7bf7ff5","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"afe0-e7c9-5df2-49e9","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Default llm max_tokens 16000 exceeds Llama 4 Maverick's 8192 limit on Bedrock","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["8d65c1c9-e3f9-4ea4-8f21-e8c8093fb3e3","db5bd3d2-c0e1-4a19-8a7e-afc4632a34ed","5f180b78-7c47-45e6-a5cf-f4a4da14923c","22a1f193-1e4e-49d7-8331-f06ea6a3f0c6","5808859e-db16-4455-883e-3aebb7bf7ff5","2ef72ac5-72e3-47be-9c63-6350db2feebd","dd3f6097-69f5-4481-bf40-081255b86b6e","e027154d-b34f-4a54-aebc-08cc28629052","601ffc1c-53f7-4761-b0e4-b1f73aa7b55c","6b844d89-1f2a-4608-b0d4-20863a90c499","4205410d-be99-419e-a6b5-9f2e40ac5943"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794494769374730002,"uuid":"c8305853-d3e3-4395-8178-a0cece2aabdb"}